<p>Mehboob e haqq, khairul bashar, islam ke baani nabi<br />
shams uz zuha, badr ud duja, noor e khuda, shaan e wali<br />
zakhmi hai dil, zakhmi jigar, ye jaanta hai kab koi<br />
wo ghum mile hai aap ko sadqe me hai saara jahan<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)<br />
Pyaare nabi ya mustafa<br />
har aankh hai girya kuna<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>1. Kya mustafa ne ghum sahe, duniya ko kab maloom hai<br />
sab ke liye rehmat hai jo,<br />
khud kis qadar mazloom hai..(2)<br />
qurbaan sab kuch kar diya<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>2. Patthar use maare gaye jo rehmat e kaunain tha<br />
taed ki galiyo me lahu<br />
behta raha behta raha..(2)<br />
phir bhi nahi ki baddua<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>3. Ye sochte hai mustafa aaghosh mein shabbir hai<br />
khanjar rawa gardan pe hai<br />
zakhmi badan mein teer hai..(2)<br />
aaegi ek din karbala<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>4. Beti pe mere baad phir har zulm dhaya jaega<br />
mohsin shahadat paega<br />
ghar ko jalaya jaega..(2)<br />
subbat ilayya ki sadaa<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>5. Hasnain hai girya kuna nana ki mayyat dekh kar<br />
baba chale hai chodkar<br />
zehra ka hai muztar jigar..(2)<br />
ab kya karegi fatima<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>6. Haider ki aankhein ashk hai taboot mein hai mustafa<br />
zehra akeli rehgayi<br />
aur puchti hai maamta..(2)<br />
wo shaam kufa karbala<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>7. Zainab ke lab par thi sadaa lut kar madine aagaye<br />
kurta liya shabbir ka<br />
marqad pe nana ki chale..(2)<br />
mehshar bapa hone laga<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)</p>

<p>8. Lega wo badla zulm ka ek din &#39;Mohammad&#39; akhri<br />
uski musibat likh sake<br />
haq hai ali safdar yahi..(2)<br />
maine qamar nauha likha<br />
Ya mustafa..(4)<br />
